    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Encabezado de página -->
        <div class="page-header-row widgets-hero">
            <div class="page-title">
                <span class="nx-eyebrow">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" style="width:13px;height:13px;stroke-width:2.2;"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="3" rx="2"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="14" rx="2"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="2"/></svg>
                    Componentes de interfaz
                </span>
                <h1><span class="hero-title-main">Catálogo de widgets</span> <span class="hero-title-faded">y selects empresariales.</span></h1>
                <p>Componentes interactivos con filtrado en tiempo real, inspirados en E-Cont ERP y CRM Suite.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="widgets-hero-badges">
                <span class="badge-status status-completed">
                    <span class="nx-live-dot"></span> 11 widgets activos
                </span>
                <span class="badge-status status-processing">Inspirado en E-Cont ERP</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="widgets-grid">

            <!-- WIDGET 1: Select Múltiple con Buscador y Checkboxes -->
            <div class="card-panel">
                <div class="widget-head">
                    <div class="widget-kicker">
                        <span class="widget-num">01 &bull; Select múltiple</span>
                        <span class="widget-tag">Checkboxes</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Select múltiple con casillas</h3>
                    <p class="widget-desc">Filtra y selecciona varios departamentos corporativos con acciones de selección rápida.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Asignar departamentos operativos</label>
                    <div class="multi-select-wrap" id="multiSelectDept">
                        <div class="multi-select-trigger" onclick="toggleSelect('multiSelectDept')">
                            <span id="labelDeptSelect" class="trigger-placeholder">Seleccionar departamentos...</span>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" class="icon-sm" style="stroke-width:2.5;"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="multi-select-dropdown" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
                            <input type="text" class="multi-select-search-bar" id="searchDeptInput" placeholder="Buscar departamento..." oninput="filterDeptOptions(this.value)">
